### Exemplary Patent Claim Language

1. **A disposable absorbent article**, comprising:  
   a front waist region configured to be positioned over a wearer’s abdominal area;  
   a rear waist region configured to be positioned over the wearer’s back;  
   a crotch region extending between the front waist region and the rear waist region and configured to be positioned between the wearer’s legs;  
   an absorbent assembly disposed in at least the crotch region, the absorbent assembly including an absorbent base and an absorber cover overlying at least a portion of the absorbent base;  
   a skin-contacting topsheet disposed on a wearer-facing side of the absorbent assembly, the skin-contacting topsheet defining a waste-receiving slit through which bodily waste is transferable toward the absorbent assembly;  
   a pair of leg elastic members positioned along respective laterally opposing sides of the crotch region and configured to form seals around the wearer’s legs; and  
   one or more buttock-contact elastic members disposed in the rear waist region and configured to resiliently engage at least a portion of the wearer’s buttocks.

2. **The disposable absorbent article of claim 1**, wherein the waste-receiving slit extends generally in a longitudinal direction of the disposable absorbent article.

3. **The disposable absorbent article of claim 1**, wherein the buttock-contact elastic members extend generally in a lateral direction across at least a portion of the rear waist region.

4. **The disposable absorbent article of claim 1**, wherein the absorber cover at least partially encloses the absorbent base.
